History

script.js and styles.css were rewritten from scratch in October 2026 as an independent
implementation, written from docs/display-spec.md. Versions of this repository up to and
including commit f8716ec contained a split-flap animation adapted from Noah Veltman's
"Departures board" gist (2018), which was published without a licence. That code is not
part of the current version.

